DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion-id: DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-2-trigger_tool: conan
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-3-phase: validating
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-4:error_signature: FAIL.*harmony-specific.*perm check.*installed perms.*expected group/other r-x|ConanException.*Error 1.*test\(\)
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-5-severity: 3
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-6-category: platform, hmdfs, testing
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-7-match_keywords: e046, chmod ignored, hmdfs, permission assertion, rule12, harmony-specific test, umask 077, r-x, local pass ci fail
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-8:title: HMDFS忽略chmod致权限位断言CI失败时改用非0600特征判据
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-9:root_cause: HarmonyOS SELinux/HMDFS静默忽略chmod()（E046），打包文件最终权限位由文件系统策略决定，断言0555/group-other r-x在CI worker上必失败而本地通过
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-10:affected_scope: test_package中对打包产物权限位的断言，以及rule12鸿蒙特有测试中任何依赖chmod生效的检查，跨库可复用
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-11:verification_cmd: CI conan-build-test步骤test_package全部通过，harmony-specific E011 mode check输出OK
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-12-rec_priority: 1
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-13-rec_approach: replace-mode-assertion-with-non-0600-check
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-14-rec_description: 将权限位断言改为可移植判据：检查安装脚本模式不是0600（未打补丁umask 077的特征），并保留umask 077下实跑过滤逻辑的行为级断言；不要断言chmod后的最终权限位
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-15-rec_command: ls -lL "$INSTALLED" | awk '{print $1}' 后case匹配 -rw-------* 判失败，其余通过
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-16-rec_auto_fix: true
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-17-rec_impl: test-package
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-18-fallback_priority: 2
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-19-fallback_approach: behavior-level-assertion
DRAFT-clamassassin-1.2.4-hmdfs-chmod-ignored-permission-assertion.kv-20-fallback_description: 权限属性类断言全部替换为行为级断言（umask 077下实跑+输出校验），与文件系统权限策略解耦
